
[x] Save Input Files between Application Runs

Add code to PrimaryController#addFile(File) that uses App.preferences to save the 
File path as a String.  Add a new static String INPUT_FILES_KEY to App.java for this.
If an input file or files are already set as a preference, then concatenate the new 
File path to them, separated by a ',' character.

Conversely, update PrimaryController#initialize() so that it looks for saved input files 
under the newly added INPUT_FILES_KEY preferences key.  If any paths are saved under that key, 
then separate them by the ',' character and pass each path as a File to a call 
to Primarycontroller#addFile(File).


